            <figcaption>{f.cap}</figcaption>
          </figure>
        ); })()}

        <h3 class="cag-h3">What Is the Honest Price Range Across Every Route?</h3>
        <p>The honest range runs from about $450 at the bottom to about $8,500 at the top, and both ends are real. We sit deliberately in the middle of it, because the bottom end usually means a bird whose history nobody can reconstruct and the top end usually means a waiting list rather than a better bird.</p>

        {(() => { const f = fig("og1"); return (
          <figure class="sec-fig">
            <img class={`sec-img ${f.kind === "inf" ? "inf-img" : "og-photo"}`} src={f.src} srcset={f.srcset}
