        <h3 class="cag-h3">What Is Included in the Price of Our African Greys?</h3>
        <p>The paperwork is inside the price, not bolted on afterwards. That is a deliberate commercial choice: itemising certificates lets a seller advertise a lower headline and recover it at checkout, and we would rather quote the number you actually pay.</p>

