        <h4 class="cag-h4">What Is the Average Cost of Caring for an African Grey Each Year?</h4>
        <p>Budget {range(annualRun)}: {money(an.food_and_treats.min)}–{money(an.food_and_treats.max)} for pellets and fresh produce, {money(an.avian_vet_wellness.min)}–{money(an.avian_vet_wellness.max)} for the annual wellness exam, {money(an.toys_replacement.min)}–{money(an.toys_replacement.max)} replacing what gets destroyed, and up to {money(an.unexpected_vet.max)} held back for the visit you did not plan.</p>

