        <h5 class="cag-h5">One Emergency Avian Vet Visit Can Exceed a Whole Year of Food</h5>
        <p>Parrots conceal illness until they cannot, which is why avian medicine tends to arrive as an emergency rather than an appointment. The contingency line is not padding — it is the difference between treating a sick bird and making a decision you did not want to make.</p>

        <h6 class="cag-h6">Line Item: Pellets, Fresh Produce, Toys, Wellness Exam, Contingency</h6>
        <p>Five recurring lines, and only the first two are predictable. We feed a reviewed rotation rather than a house brand, and our <a href="/african-grey-parrot-care-guide/">care guide sets out the routine we hand every buyer</a> so the annual figure stays where we said it would.</p>
      </section>

      <div class="seam"><img src={seam} width="150" height="50" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>

      <!-- K4 CLIPBOARD TAKEAWAY -->
      <aside class="k4" aria-label="What the headline fee does not cover">
        <div class="k4-head">
          <p class="k4-k">The gap between the fee and the cost</p>
          <p class="k4-h">What No Adoption Fee or Sticker Price Includes</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="k4-list">
          <li><span class="k4-x" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="12" height="12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span><span>A cage sized for an adult Congo, at {money(fy.cage_large.min)}–{money(fy.cage_large.max)}</span></li>
          <li><span class="k4-x" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="12" height="12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span><span>Transport, which is {money(airport)} to {money(home)} on our routes and rarely bundled on any other</span></li>
          <li><span class="k4-x" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="12" height="12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span><span>Forty years of food, at {money(an.food_and_treats.min)}–{money(an.food_and_treats.max)} annually</span></li>
          <li><span class="k4-x" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="12" height="12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span><span>The emergency vet fund, up to {money(an.unexpected_vet.max)} you hope never to spend</span></li>
          <li><span class="k4-x" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="12" height="12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"/></svg></span><span>Your time — the one line no route can invoice and no buyer can outsource</span></li>
        </ul>
