            </div>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="xsell">
          <p class="xsell-k">Also from our aviary</p>
          <p><a href="/african-grey-breeding-pair-for-sale/">Breeding stock carries its own price logic</a>, because a proven producer is valued on its record rather than on how tame it is.</p>
          <p><a href="/african-grey-parrot-bird-eggs-for-sale-usa/">Incubating your own clutch</a> looks cheaper per bird until you price the incubator, the failure rate, and sixteen weeks of hand-feeding against your own time.</p>
          <p><a href="/affordable-african-grey-birds-for-sale/">Our lowest-priced documented greys</a> gather every bird sitting at the bottom of our range in one place.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="seam"><img src={seam} width="150" height="50" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>

      <!-- CONTACT / RESERVE -->
      <section class="sec" id="inquire">
        <h3 class="cag-h3">How Do You Reserve One of These Birds?</h3>
        <div class="form-wrap form-2col">
